<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Datum Inc raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Datum Inc raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said it upgraded Datum Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- raised the 1998 earnings estimate to $1.35 a share from $1.15 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a price target of $25 a share. Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Datum gained one to 17.</p>
</text>
